  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att etablera en utvecklad infrastruktur runt Russian Quality Awards RQA, och en fortsatt spridning och till&#xe4;mpning av TQM (Total Quality Management) inom ryskt n&#xe4;ringsliv. Huvudm&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r projektet &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra konkurrenskraften inom rysk industri. Kurser, utbildnings- och instruktionspaket &#xe4;r medel i fas 3. Svensk part &#xe4;r Recomate AB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to promote a quality thinking in Russian industry and hereby improve russian competitiveness. This phase of the project includes the establishment of a sustainble infrastructure of the RQA program through a Russian Quality Institute at Gosstandard and training of personel, books etc. Swedish counterpart is Recomate AB.</narrative>
  </description>
